REST API Design (Beers)

| HTTP Method | Endpoint    | Description                         |
| ----------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------- |
| POST        | /beers      | Create a new beer object            |
| GET         | /beers      | Retrieve all beer objects           |
| GET         | /beers/{id} | Retrieve a single beer object by ID |
| PUT         | /beers/{id} | Update the entire beer object       |
| PATCH       | /beers/{id} | Update part of the beer object      |
| DELETE      | /beers/{id} | Delete a beer object                |